{"articleNo":"890","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=890&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"MSC 및 전공과목 멘토 지원 계획 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.08.28","hit":"13677","attachments":[{"name":"2009교육역량멘토링지원계획(홍보용).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=890&attachNo=69935"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n</p><table width=\"584\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td width=\"578\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"style3\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: red; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>『2009 교육역량강화사업』의</strong></font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"style3\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>MSC 및 전공과목 멘토 지원 계획 안내</strong></font></span><span class=\"style3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br><br><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></font></span></span> </p>\n            <div align=\"left\">\n            <table style=\"BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"612\" border=\"1\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-TOP-WIDTH: 0.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT-WIDTH: 0.4pt; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: rgb(102,102,102); BORDER-BOTTOM-WIDTH: 0.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: rgb(102,102,102); PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: rgb(102,102,102); PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-RIGHT-WIDTH: 0.4pt; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: rgb(102,102,102)\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"605\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"195\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 10pt 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼매직체\"><font face=\"굴림\">2009년 교육역량강화사업의 일환으로 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼매직체; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">MSC 및</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼매직체; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"> 전공과목에 대한 흥미유발과 내실 있는 전공능력</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼매직체\"><font face=\"굴림\"> </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼매직체; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">향상을 위하여</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼매직체\"><font face=\"굴림\"> 우리대학교 재학생으로서 대학원 및 학부 고학년의 학생이 해당과목에 대하여 관심이 있는 학생, 해당과목을 이수하였으나 성적이 부진한 학생들을 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼매직체; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">대상으로 MSC 및 전공과목을 지도할 수 있도록 아래와 같이 멘토 지원 계획을 안내 하오니 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼매직체\"><font face=\"굴림\">많은 학생들의 참여를 바랍니다.</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"left\"><span class=\"style3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span></span></p>\n            <p></p>\n            <p></p>\n            <p></p>\n            <p></p>\n            <div align=\"left\"><span class=\"style3\"><br></span>\n            <table style=\"BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none\" bordercolor=\"#808080\" width=\"612\" border=\"1\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"123\" bgcolor=\"#99ccff\" height=\"46\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><strong>구&nbsp;&nbsp; 분</strong></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"384\" bgcolor=\"#99ccff\" height=\"46\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><strong>&nbsp;내&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 용</strong></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#99ccff\" height=\"46\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><strong>비 고</strong></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"123\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"83\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 93.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">멘 토 대 상</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"384\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"83\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" align=\"center\">대학원생, 또는 해당과목에 대한 우수한 성적을 가진 고학년 학부 재학생으로 담당할 교과목의 지도교수 추천을 받은 자<br><font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong>** 세부사항은 해당 전공에 문의하여 신청 하시기 바랍니다 **</strong></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"83\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">재학생</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"123\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"125\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 99.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -89.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">멘 티 대 상</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"384\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"125\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" align=\"center\">- 해당과목에 대하여 관심이 있는 학생</p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" align=\"center\">- 해당과목을 이수하였으나 성적이 부진한 학생</p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" align=\"center\">&nbsp; ☞ 멘티인원 : 그룹의 최소 인원은 3명이상,</p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;적정인원을 5명 ~ 10명으로 제한</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"125\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"123\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"54\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">지&nbsp;&nbsp; 원&nbsp; 비</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"384\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"54\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" align=\"center\">멘토자별 500,000원/25시간 기준</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"54\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"123\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"54\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">신 청&nbsp;기 간</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"384\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"54\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" align=\"center\">2009. 9. 1(화) ~ 9. 18(금)</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"54\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"123\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"54\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">신 청 장 소</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"384\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"54\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" align=\"center\">소속 학부(과)의 종합학사 행정실</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"54\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">전공별<br>접수</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"123\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"85\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">지도&nbsp;교과목</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"384\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"85\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" align=\"center\">2009-2학기에 개설된 모든 MSC과목 및 전공과목<br>☞ 멘토운영 교과목은 MSC교과목을 <br>우선으로 지정하시기 바람</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"85\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"123\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"67\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">운 영&nbsp;기 간</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"384\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"67\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">2009. 09. 1 ～ 2009. 12. 11일까지<br>☞ 멘토실시는 학부(과)의 승인 후 자유스럽게 실시</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"67\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">2학기 중</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <table style=\"BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none\" bordercolor=\"#808080\" width=\"612\" border=\"1\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"122\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"308\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;신 청&nbsp;절 차</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"385\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"308\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;멘토를 희망하는 학생은 학부(과, 전공)장에게 신청서를 제출 ⇒ 학부(과)장은 학부(과, 전공)별로 배정된 멘토인원 범위내에서 멘토자 선발 ⇒ 멘토자는 멘티인원을 선발(최소 3명, 5 ~ 10명 범위내) ⇒ 학부장은 멘토 지도를 위한 지도교수(멘토 인원에 관계 없음)를 선임 ⇒ 멘토 승인 ⇒ 멘토 실시 ⇒ 멘토 학생은 결과보고서를 학부(과, 전공)장에게 제출 ⇒ 학부(과)장은 멘토 선발자 명단 및 종료 후 결과보고서를 교무연구과에 제출 ⇒ 멘토지원비 지급</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"308\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"122\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"164\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">역할 및&nbsp;임무</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"385\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"164\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\" align=\"center\">- 멘토 시간은 25시간 이상이어야 함 </p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\" align=\"center\">- 멘토링 운영일지, 멘토링 출석부를 작성하여야 함</p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\" align=\"center\">- 멘토활동 종료 후 결과보고서 및 관련서류를 멘토 지도교수의 확인을 받아 학부 (과)에 제출하여야 함</p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\" align=\"center\">- 운영일지는 반드시 멘토 지도교수의 확인을 받아야 함</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"164\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"122\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"256\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">의 무 사 항</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"385\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"256\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\" align=\"center\">멘토를 수행한 학생은 수업 종료와 동시에<br>다음의 서류를 학부(과)장에게 제출 하여야 한다.</p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;° 멘토링 결과보고서<br>&nbsp;° 멘토링 운영일지 및 내용 요약서<br>&nbsp;° 멘토링 출석부<br>&nbsp;° 멘토 신분증 사본 및 통장사본<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 학생이 “멘토의 역할 및 의무”사항을 이행하지 <br>않은 경우 지원비를 지급할 수 없음</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"256\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(102,102,102) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" width=\"601\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"90\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 32.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong>&nbsp;2009.&nbsp; 8.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong></span></p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 32.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong>금오공과대학교총장</strong></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            </div>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td width=\"578\"></td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
